<title>USA: Physicians Resource files counterclaims.</title>
<headline>Physicians Resource files counterclaims.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physicians Resource Group Inc said Tuesday that it has filed counterclaims against EquiMed Inc in the action between the companies pending in the American Arbitration Association in Philadelphia.</p>
<p>In May, EquiMed said it filed claims against Physicians seeking damages of about $30 million for breach of an asset purchase agreement.</p>
<p>Physicians' counterclaims include breach of representations and warranties, fraud and conversion.</p>
<p>Physicians said it seeks relief, including compensatory damages of $45 million and punitive damages.</p>
</text>
